{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. If approached, grab it. Check its properties, move, drop it, and do specific task. Scan for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
